From 58c3451185e3209b77d2af347c4be02955156d25 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Louis Liao <lliao@axiado.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:05:42 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Port OpenSMA to a Linux USB Gadget kernel module.

The LSTP gadget function lives under misc/ but does not need host support,
so descend into it explicitly rather than relying on CONFIG_USB.

Lives under misc/ but is a gadget function, so it must not be gated on
host side USB support the way drivers/usb/misc/Kconfig is.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Louis Liao <lliao@axiado.com>
